# Implementation Plan: Redesign of Mathematical Equation Generation Pipeline (`FormulaEngine`)

## Executive Summary
This implementation plan outlines the complete architectural redesign of the mathematical formula rendering pipeline for Academic Universe publications (specifically Paper 2 Version 1.0). 

Instead of ad-hoc text replacements or direct string injections, we build a dedicated, modular, production-grade **`FormulaEngine`** following the Pandoc/texmath industry standard. The pipeline parses LaTeX math expressions into a formal Abstract Syntax Tree (AST), compiles the AST into canonical Microsoft Office Math (OMML) OpenXML nodes (`<m:oMath>` and `<m:oMathPara>`), validates the output via a strict OpenXML Scanner Layer that aborts build exports if any raw LaTeX or broken Unicode survives, and verifies PDF parity.

