## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict Validation Rule**: The build export pipeline will automatically fail and terminate if a single raw LaTeX command string (`\frac`, `\sum`, `\lambda`, `\epsilon`, etc.) or replacement character (`U+FFFD`) is found anywhere in the generated OpenXML document tree.

> [!NOTE]
> All display equations will be rendered as native Cambria Math OMML objects with IEEE right-aligned equation numbers `(1)` through `(5)`. All inline variables and math symbols will be rendered as inline OMML objects.

